## 9.2 스레드 동기화

### 9.2.1 Atomic 연산

```julia
using Base.Threads

counter = Atomic{Int}(0)

@threads for i in 1:1000000
    atomic_add!(counter, 1)     # 안전한 증가
end

count = counter[]
```

### 9.2.2 뮤텍스 & 락

```julia
using Base.Threads

lock = ReentrantLock()
shared_value = 0

@threads for i in 1:1000
    lock(lock) do
        shared_value += 1
    end
end
```

